# #167 Lich King: three jab presses play the Pommel and Rake chain (gauntlet, rake, Frostmourne
# thrust), each hit captured on its first active frame. Lich King a against Lich King b, which runs
# in and stands. Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero lich king
# Input starts after frame 500: on a loaded host the helpers first see a quick match up to ~400 frames in.
# b dashes in, then walks 24 frames toward a, inside the gauntlet check.
540 b stick -1 0
560 b stick 0 0
590 b press LB
590 b stick -1 0
614 b stick 0 0
614 b release LB
650 a tap A 2
655 a capture
659 a tap A 2
667 a capture
668 a tap A 2
681 a capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
# Expected (headless run of this script): the gauntlet check, rake and thrust each hit.
#! expect a 650 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect b 655 damage 3.000
#! expect a 661 applied attack 2 style 20
#! expect b 667 damage 6.000
#! expect a 673 applied attack 3 style 21
#! expect b 681 damage 11.000
